# Remember plugin: session buffers, logs, tmp state. Nothing here is reproducible
# input -- it is scratch. The folder carries its own .gitignore containing `*`,
# but that pattern also matches the .gitignore itself, so it can never be committed
# and a fresh clone would lose the protection. Hence naming it here.
.remember/

# Python tooling under Sentence Islands/tools
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.env
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Generated audio. The per-sentence clips in audio/ ARE committed -- they are what a
# browser-based drill needs to fetch, and GitHub Pages cannot serve Git LFS pointers.
# These two stitched tracks are derived output: ~5.3 MB of a 7.2 MB repo, rebuilt any
# time by `python tools/build_audio.py <Language> --voice <voice>`.
# Delete this line if you want them served by the live site.
Sentence Islands/*/out/

# Windows, OneDrive and editor cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.tmp
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs
*.log
